== Method

=== Development Phases and Agent Specialization

The development will follow an Agile methodology with strong TDD principles. Each phase concludes with comprehensive code review and adversarial testing by a dedicated Testing Agent to maintain quality and security. A Phase Lead agent manages each phase with the Manager/Coordinator overseeing cross-phase alignment.

[cols="1,2,3,2", options="header"]
|===
| Phase
| Objectives
| Required AI Agents
| Estimated Agent Count

| Phase 1: Core Chain Protocol
| - Block, transaction, and UTXO design  
  - PoW consensus using quantum-safe hash  
  - Block production and validation  
  - Chain selection logic (longest valid chain)  
  - Difficulty recalculated every block  
| - Architect Agent  
  - Protocol Engineer Agent  
  - Storage & Ledger Agent  
  - Testing & Validation Agent  
| 4 (1 per specialty)

| Phase 2: P2P Networking Layer
| - Decentralized node discovery  
  - Message propagation (inv, block, tx)  
  - Sovereign bootstrap mechanism  
| - Network & P2P Agent  
  - Testing & Validation Agent  
| 2

